    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/be667158b45cca49af3b270e3ebf51b0.avif?t=1748380545\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/fcf3f17f60a6512bf2aaa546f86eed4b.avif?t=1748380545\" width=569 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sequel to My Femboy Roommate, you take your roommate turned boyfriend, Robin, to a fancy resort for your one year anniversary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and enjoy everything the high-end resort has to offer while bonding and growing closer to Robin. Lounge by the pool, indulge in the amenities, and make new connections\u2014all while preparing something unforgettable to close off your weekend with Robin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you spend your special weekend with Robin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/40b24a0339f7a305528763e795e607fb.avif?t=1748380545\" width=569 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full, original English voice acting for all story scenes and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and mini-games that unlock new scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated CGs for most spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translations for multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alternate storyline that is unlocked once the base game is completed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full replay gallery where you can unlock and replay all unlocked scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSFW and SFW modes that you can toggle in game, which are perfect streamers who want to avoid any adult content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/2690b186c221c02dc2d2dab97ae8b59a.poster.avif?t=1748380545\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/2690b186c221c02dc2d2dab97ae8b59a.webm?t=1748380545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/2690b186c221c02dc2d2dab97ae8b59a.mp4?t=1748380545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
